---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
// demo/p12/Dockerfile: two FROM lines. Only /app/.venv (44.9 MB in the
// `docker history` capture) crosses from the build stage to the runtime stage.
const W = 900, H = 300;
---
<figure class="bep12c">
  <div class="bep12c-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Two Docker stages. The build stage holds the uv binary and runs uv sync with the lockfile. Only the virtual environment, 44.9 megabytes, is copied into the runtime stage, which holds Python, that environment, two source files, and runs as user 10001. The build stage is thrown away.">
    <rect x="40" y="40" width="300" height="190" rx="10" class="box" />
    <DiagramIcon name="build" x="74" y="76" size={26} />
    <text x="106" y="72" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>build stage</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>stage build</tspan></text>
    <text x="106" y="92" class="sm"><tspan data-lang-en>never shipped</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>không bao giờ được ship</tspan></text>
    <text x="64" y="132" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>python:3.13-slim</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>python:3.13-slim</tspan></text>
    <text x="64" y="158" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>uv 0.13.0 binary</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>binary uv 0.13.0</tspan></text>
    <text x="64" y="184" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>uv sync --frozen --no-dev</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>uv sync --frozen --no-dev</tspan></text>
    <text x="64" y="210" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>result: /app/.venv</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>kết quả: /app/.venv</tspan></text>
    <line x1="340" y1="135" x2="552" y2="135" class="line fm-flow" />
    <polygon points="552,127 568,135 552,143" class="arrow" />
    <text x="454" y="122" text-anchor="middle" class="sm"><tspan data-lang-en>COPY --from=build</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>COPY --from=build</tspan></text>
    <text x="454" y="158" text-anchor="middle" class="num"><tspan data-lang-en>44.9 MB</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>44.9 MB</tspan></text>
    <rect x="570" y="40" width="290" height="190" rx="10" class="box run" />
    <DiagramIcon name="docker" x="604" y="76" size={26} />
    <text x="636" y="72" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>runtime stage</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>stage runtime</tspan></text>
    <text x="636" y="92" class="sm red"><tspan data-lang-en>the image you ship</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>image bạn ship</tspan></text>
    <text x="594" y="132" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>python:3.13-slim</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>python:3.13-slim</tspan></text>
    <text x="594" y="158" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>/app/.venv</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>/app/.venv</tspan></text>
    <text x="594" y="184" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>p12_settings.py, p12_app.py</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>p12_settings.py, p12_app.py</tspan></text>
    <text x="594" y="210" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>USER 10001, exec-form CMD</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>USER 10001, CMD dạng exec</tspan></text>
    <text x="40" y="272" class="note"><tspan data-lang-en>the resolver, the uv binary and the build cache stay behind</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>resolver, binary uv và cache build ở lại stage build</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Two FROM lines in demo/p12/Dockerfile. Tools live in the first stage; the second stage copies only what runs.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Hai dòng FROM trong demo/p12/Dockerfile. Công cụ nằm ở stage đầu; stage sau chỉ copy thứ chạy được.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .bep12c { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .bep12c-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .bep12c svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 700px; height: auto; }
  .bep12c text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .bep12c .t { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 15px; }
  .bep12c .b { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .bep12c .sm, .bep12c .note { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 13px; }
  .bep12c .num { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 20px; }
  .bep12c text.red { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep12c .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; stroke-dasharray: 6 5; }
  .bep12c .box.run { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2.2; stroke-dasharray: none; }
  .bep12c .line { stroke: var(--text-faint); stroke-width: 2; }
  .bep12c .arrow { fill: var(--text-faint); }
  .bep12c figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
